      "translation": "\"Förde\" (gacan badeed)",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-1:meaning",
      "translation": "Gacan badeed oo dheer oo cidhiidhi ah oo ka mid ah Badda Baltiga, kuna gasha dhulka gudihiisa meel fog.",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-2",
      "translation": "Kieler Woche (Toddobaadka Kiel)",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-2:meaning",
      "translation": "Dabaaldeg weyn oo doomaha shiraaca ah bisha Juun, leh muusig iyo doomo adduunka oo dhan ka yimid.",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-3",
      "translation": "markabka gudbinta",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-3:meaning",
      "translation": "Markab weyn oo dadka iyo baabuurta qaada, tusaale ahaan una socda Norway.",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-4",
      "translation": "Kanaalka Kiel (Nord-Ostsee-Kanal)",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-kiel-matching-4:meaning",
      "translation": "Marin biyood oo dad sameeyay oo u dhexeeya Badda Waqooyi iyo Badda Baltiga.",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
